#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0746 expect=noViolation domain=ADAE
# Rule:Description: SRCDOM has a value that is not an SDTM domain name, ADaM dataset name, or null
#note "SRCDOM = adsl names the ADaM dataset ADSL in lower case. Dataset names match case-insensitively (owner, 2026-10-01), and upper(SRCDOM) is ADSL, which is in dataset_names(), so no violation. ADaM datasets have no DOMAIN column, which is why the dataset-name list stays beside study_domains()."
# Declared-tier scope: structure= states the ADaM data structure this minimal table stands for;
# #define is its mandatory carrier (ScenarioDeclaredScopeProvider.install).
#define standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADAE structure=BDS
col SRCDOM type=Char
---
adsl
---

dataset ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
---
STUDY01
---
